'''Frostfire Greatsword''' is a version of [[Nord Greatsword]] upgraded with a [[Frostfire Essence]]. It loses a small amount of [[Slash|slash damage]] in exchange for a larger amount of [[fire]] and [[Frost|frost damage]].

* The primary attack is a wide 3-hit attack combo with double damage on the last hit.
* Its slower secondary attack is a thrust that deals 3x damage.

An upgraded Nord Greatsword will '''NOT''' keep its upgrade level when it is crafted into Frostfire Greatsword.

