* Frostfire Greatsword can also be upgraded at the [[Forge of Potential]] with a [[Bloodgold Battle Idol]].

== Notes ==
* The primary attacks are fairly vertical and wide reaching, with the third attack in the combo being more narrow in the horizontal plane.
* The secondary attack is a long reaching thrust that is capable of outreaching most enemies.

